<title>USA: Brownsville, Texas $3.540 mln won by Nike Sec..</title>
<headline>Brownsville, Texas $3.540 mln won by Nike Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities said it won $3.540 million of Brownsville, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 5.057 percent.</p>
</text>
